    "body": "The format doesn't have \"fields\" as such. Maybe we should say \"Non-conforming blocks\"?\r\n\r\nWe need to define whether other data is permitted to follow a block with BFINAL set. I think we should find out what zlib does and specify that. https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc7692#section-7.2.1 implies that to implement WebSocket permessage-deflate correctly requires some special handling of BFINAL=1 blocks, but maybe that can be an option to add later.",
