    "body": "Done.\r\n\r\nBFINAL is described in RFC1951.\r\n\r\n```\r\n         BFINAL is set if and only if this is the last block of the data\r\n         set.\r\n```\r\n\r\nWe cannot generate an error after closing a stream, so we ignore such blocks. Is it worth mentioning?\r\n\r\nThe special handling for permessage-deflate is needed because we tried to save a few bytes, which we don't do for this, IIUC.",
