    "body": "> We cannot generate an error after closing a stream, so we ignore such blocks. Is it worth mentioning?\r\n\r\nHmm, I was wrong. The decompression stream has two end-of-stream signals, one is the close() call and the other is BFINAL. We should fire an error when these two signals match with each other.",
